{"text": "My friend, sometimes nothing good happens to you because you are the good that happens to others. Let me explain.\n\nThere are people whose spirit is like a lantern. Quiet, steady, glowing. They guide and comfort everyone around them, and still walk through their own dark alone.\n\nPerhaps you know this. You give your strength, your patience, your kindness. You hold others together even when your own heart is tired, and life does not return the same softness to you. That is not misfortune. It is because you are the blessing.\n\nWhen others are lost, they find you. When the world turns heavy, your presence becomes the calm inside their storm. But even the river that feeds every living thing must receive rain, my friend.\n\nIf you are the one who holds everyone, write the word lantern below, and follow me for the rest.\n\nA lantern that is never refilled goes out quietly, and nobody notices until the dark. Everything I know is inside The Quiet Between Thoughts. The link is in my profile.", "alignment": {"characters": ["M", "y", " ", "f", "r", "i", "e", "n", "d", ",", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "t", "i", "m", "e", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "g", "o", "o", "d", " ", "h", "a", "p", "p", "e", "n", "s", " ", "t", "o", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "b", "e", "c", "a", "u", "s", "e", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "o", "o", "d", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "h", "a", "p", "p", "e", "n", "s", " ", "t", "o", " ", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", "s", ".", " ", "L", "e", "t", " ", "m", "e", " ", "e", "x", "p", "l", "a", "i", "n", ".", "\n", "\n", "T", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "w", "h", "o", "s", "e", " ", "s", "p", "i", "r", "i", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "l", "a", "n", "t", "e", "r", "n", ".", " ", "Q", "u", "i", "e", "t", ",", " ", "s", "t", "e", "a", "d", "y", ",", " ", "g", "l", "o", "w", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "T", "h", "e", "